Test fixtures
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The files under tests/golden/ are output captured from a build of OctoMap C++
1.10.0 — coordinate conversions, tree states, and two map files it wrote. They
are measurements of the original software's behavior, generated by the programs
in scripts/, and are covered by the same BSD 3-Clause terms.
